# Storage

- Every route names its owner in `routeOwners`; access rules are route guards throwing `s3Error`.
- Saving: `toOwnedPublicUrl` (owner from the session) → write the URL → `after(() => deleteRouteObjects(…))`.
- Reference: `apps/web/src/app/action/dashboard/account/set-account-avatar-action.ts`.

